A note on accuracy
------------------

This content records how well each report is attested rather than presenting
everything as equally certain: events carry the source's own ✓ / ≈ marks and
its A/B/C date grades, dates keep their original hedges, and places are marked
established, traditional or disputed. The English and German translations are
machine-produced and NOT yet reviewed by a human — every generated file says so
in its `translation.status` field, and the interface shows a banner. Please
keep those signals intact in any derivative work; stripping them would
misrepresent the material.
